  "title": "Netflix and AMC+ Sign Major Streaming Deal for 'The Walking Dead'",
  "summary": "Netflix has secured a $500 million licensing agreement to expand its streaming rights to The Walking Dead and its six spinoffs, while AMC+ is also involved in the deal. The deal aims to capitalize on the popularity of the series in both domestic and international markets.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Netflix has signed a $500 million licensing agreement to bring The Walking Dead Universe to international markets.",
      "confidence": 0.95
