    {
      "statement": "The deal includes streaming rights to the show and its spinoffs, as confirmed by the source.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The $500 million amount is part of a larger investment by Netflix to expand its global reach.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
